  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You know how to take a fall and how to recover from throw attacks.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dexterity 13, Acrobatics 3 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If the character is thrown or knocked down to a prone position in melee combat, she immediately recovers and stands up as a free action, though she still takes damage (if any).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc71\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
